%% CI/CD & deployment pipeline.
flowchart LR
    Dev["local: bun dev"] -->|commit| PR["pull request"]
    PR --> CI["ci.yml<br/>typecheck · lint · test · e2e · build"]
    CI -->|"cargo check --tests"| RustCrate["crates/ecology"]
    CI -->|pytest| PyService["services/agents"]
    CI -->|green| Merge["merge to main"]
    Merge --> Release["release.yml<br/>tag → GitHub Release"]
    Merge --> Vercel["deploy-vercel.yml<br/>vercel --prod"]
    Vercel --> URL["live URL<br/>vercel.app"]
    Merge --> Alt["Fly / Render / Railway<br/>(configs in repo)"]
